6. Creating an MCP Layer

MCP transforms existing APIs into discoverable AI tools.

MCP Server

from mcp.server.fastmcp import FastMCP

mcp = FastMCP("Predictor")

@mcp.tool()
def predict(x: float):
    return x * 2

if __name__ == "__main__":
    mcp.run()


