---

Conclusion

Organizations already operating Docker workloads possess most of the infrastructure required to become AI-native. By introducing MCP as a capability layer, existing applications can be transformed into discoverable tools consumable by AI agents without rewriting core business logic.

The migration path is therefore not:

Legacy \rightarrow Replacement

but rather:

Legacy \rightarrow Containerization \rightarrow Cloud \rightarrow MCP

enabling existing software assets to participate directly in the emerging agent ecosystem.


